(
    title: "Stargate",
    description: Some("Defender\'s humanoid-rescue war, extended and driven with two joysticks: the left flies and fires, while the right drops Smartbombs, triggers the Inviso cloak, or jumps to hyperspace. Stellar Gateways warp you straight to wherever Landers are lifting humanoids — carry four rescued ones through a Gateway early on and you skip three waves — and Yllabian Dog Fights and Firebomber showdowns punctuate a campaign of up to 100 waves."),
